          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmïnchï korï cho le pöröris monïngay kaynat, kïkurö Oped, akïlentöy, “Kakïyichï worö Naomi.” Kïlïkwï Oped papoto Yese nyo le papoto Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.17",
